<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Linde downgraded at Lehman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Linde downgraded at Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>German engineering group Linde AG was cut to &quot;underperform&quot; from &quot;neutral&quot; at Lehman Brothers, a research note from analyst Chris Heminway at the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>The note said Linde was trading at a premium to other German engineers while it was still unclear what the company would do with proceeds from its 1995 rights issue.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
